  "text:I reach for the bun.": "/audio/1eae56b7fa70171c38e984d9.mp3",
  "text:Mum smiles. “What do we say?”": "/audio/c2130e2cab84ba31066b264a.mp3",
  "text:A bun is on my plate.": "/audio/c07b271006664c8de82cea1a.mp3",
  "text:“Bismillah!” I say.": "/audio/9f83e4b56a133a7352a52351.mp3",
