  "text:Yes! There are three flowers.": "/audio/9958ca66394a43403fc060c5.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. Count one, two, three. There are three flowers.": "/audio/b3ef41132f20783a7aab737d.mp3",
  "text:Yes! Three birds are in the tree.": "/audio/236669e402962604bce4d045.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. Count the birds on the branches: one, two, three.": "/audio/487f118f1c007a6443baf3dd.mp3",
  "text:Yes! Five flowers. Two plus three equals five.": "/audio/00e5fe46f0801bf390c07f5c.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. Two red flowers and three yellow flowers make five altogether.": "/audio/c50faf929b08fe6d52f32991.mp3",
  "text:Yes! Two birds are left.": "/audio/126e57d2828f9a61178d3fec.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. One bird flew away. Count the two birds still in the tree.": "/audio/364b37a84bd783e49abf6a36.mp3",
  "text:Yes! Each brother gets one piece. They all get the same amount.": "/audio/663b6be79648997ddb6aaac0.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. Look at each plate. There is one equal piece on each plate.": "/audio/279137eac72321e57aa98a6e.mp3",
  "text:Yes! Six apples. Three groups of two equals six.": "/audio/81439016f5d6baf7c33fb1a5.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. Count two apples in each of the three baskets. Two, four, six.": "/audio/749f53f7b4ef0071470fee3c.mp3",
  "text:Yes! A triangle has three sides.": "/audio/10544c72c208ea3ec2cb15f8.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. Follow the triangle’s three straight sides. A square has four. A circle has no straight sides.": "/audio/b0f14c6f38ec1450e1ca6ae6.mp3",
  "text:Yes! The blue ribbon is longer.": "/audio/f46987b4a7026c63c52211cf.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. Both ribbons start at the same place. The blue ribbon reaches farther.": "/audio/e0d79ce3536f2dbef5e0f9c6.mp3",
  "text:Yes! The blue cup has more water.": "/audio/5a678c7ed7601b1f440bf4f0.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. The cups are the same size. The blue cup has the higher water level.": "/audio/169d3a059d1356c67f8ee012.mp3",
  "text:Yes! Eight taka. Five plus three equals eight.": "/audio/74bad735f2b7045f9256966d.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. Add five taka for the mango and three taka for the banana. The total is eight taka.": "/audio/8c961cd3435ea2dc0a0fdda6.mp3",
  "text:Yes! It is three o’clock.": "/audio/2deb29c46c2bfb1aac7d28d1.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. The short hand points to three. The long hand points to twelve.": "/audio/8e5d4b1e5be5db78fccc0224.mp3",
  "text:Yes! The bird has the most. Three is more than two.": "/audio/8993126867c764f4aca6c2d1.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. Count three stickers for the bird and two for the flower. The bird has more.": "/audio/0b56fe95557afa2747f3b92a.mp3",
  "text:Yes! One more sticker. Three minus two equals one.": "/audio/727fc95297152925568caaea.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. Match two stickers in each row. The bird has one extra sticker.": "/audio/6b69d0b716761c501ffe804c.mp3",
  "text:Yes! The grass in sunlight stayed green.": "/audio/2763d33d1087acd8b2b9fb65.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. The green grass had sunlight. The covered grass became pale over several days.": "/audio/f5dc78c206b4c5663a9fa295.mp3",
  "text:Yes! The Sun warms the water.": "/audio/9255f0a0e744160d9e9951bb.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. Look at the sunlight warming the river.": "/audio/f95478425b5d3f98cccf75b3.mp3",
  "text:Yes! Rain falls from the clouds.": "/audio/49fa38588fee1e79b58b7bca.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. The tiny cloud drops join into larger drops that fall as rain.": "/audio/f26deca8302a201836ea742a.mp3",
  "text:Yes! The lungs help us breathe.": "/audio/38e90201e9f6e3ec092f3abb.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. Find the two blue lungs in the chest. They help us breathe.": "/audio/efa59a8a3f789990c0c8acd6.mp3",
  "text:Yes! The heart pumps blood.": "/audio/b81667175b7dcce87ca152e8.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. The heart is the pump. It moves blood around the body.": "/audio/682999c30096fde0096f679c.mp3",
  "text:Yes! We hear with our ears.": "/audio/7076f036fd8c16ed8d8b9c28.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. The bell makes a sound. Our ears help us hear it.": "/audio/6b6eb4ad37c023784bfde5be.mp3",
  "text:Yes! We taste with our tongue.": "/audio/68e782d2031e8a9d7a8bac97.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. The tongue helps us taste the apple. The nose helps us smell.": "/audio/c70ddb57593595b4552dd251.mp3",
  "text:Yes! We showed the frog by a pond.": "/audio/6ed532c0867d1907aea67fc0.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. Remember the frog beside the water. Its home in our story is the pond.": "/audio/05826376b1ca7fd20f2f853e.mp3",
  "text:Yes! We showed the cow on a farm.": "/audio/3f123923e1fc42195927eddf.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. Remember the cow near the barn. We showed a farm.": "/audio/bbe3ed3c6a4089e707c2165a.mp3",
  "text:Yes! The place facing the Sun has daylight.": "/audio/0b6b8b1f28c4de790a643772.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. The Sun lights the side facing it. The other side is dark.": "/audio/12ba2fd21a9eb98d3bf10929.mp3",
  "text:Yes! The wooden block floated.": "/audio/7d877bc7e316dfd298bde68b.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. The wooden block stayed at the water surface. The solid steel key went down.": "/audio/3fe6263d59365fb67a7e7891.mp3",
  "text:Yes! The solid steel key sank.": "/audio/c63a8a75d699bb640a03beab.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. Look at the key at the bottom of the water.": "/audio/1939e78bd7a0bf795287dcfe.mp3",
  "text:Yes! The toy is pushed away.": "/audio/c6fddb8d4e42345e09ecb3c2.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. A push moves the toy away from the child. A pull brings the wagon closer.": "/audio/e831b5776b500a0095024e14.mp3",
  "text:Yes! The wagon is pulled closer.": "/audio/8d5044eba8c1a62ae0191c6f.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. Look at the rope pulling the wagon toward the child.": "/audio/afcf060af0ad273f55e93810.mp3",
  "text:Yes! The magnet pulled the steel paper clip.": "/audio/2abe372b94c366f801d3b1a9.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. This plain steel clip is magnetic. The wood and aluminium foil did not move.": "/audio/eaa2b5cba4e67313a957b0fc.mp3",
  "text:Yes! The aluminium foil stayed still. Not every metal is pulled by our magnet.": "/audio/c174e98d03b4c0f35111db6a.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. The foil is metal, but this ordinary magnet did not pull it.": "/audio/57b4c4bebc296eef8b1ac673.mp3",
  "text:Yes! This lamp is on. It gives light.": "/audio/887a5c8558181ff0275e0253.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. Look for the yellow glow from the lit lamp.": "/audio/de7602fd419bc8e9009bb3a3.mp3",
  "text:Yes! The switch turns the light on and off.": "/audio/cc1e4c18d6ca97756c9dc2d4.mp3",
  "text:Thank you for trying. Tap the pretend switch to change the lamp.": "/audio/bff18a79122788219c391cd4.mp3",
  "text:Good job!": "/audio/0b4e71ddc5bd919d79e5d658.mp3",
