  "text:Drag the red group toward the yellow group, or use the button.": "/audio/8a9766415f05ba295a390a32.mp3",
  "text:What do you predict? We will test and find out.": "/audio/41758843a9ca2abcd156e5c6.mp3",
  "text:Drag the short hand toward 3, or choose three o’clock.": "/audio/1a4b3235d17dfc9aae647d66.mp3",
